<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34081" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Pătăra</span></b> , ae,
			f., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Παταρα</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a seaport town of
				Lycia</i>, <i>with a celebrated oracle of
			Apollo</i>, <i><span class="en">Mel. 1, 15, 3</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 5, 27,
				28, § 100</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Liv. 33,
			41</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Vulg. Act. 21, 1</span></i>; Serv <i><span class="en">Verg. A. 4,
				143</span></i>.—Hence, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Pātăreus</span></b> 
				(<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">trisyl.</span></b> ), e=i
			and ĕos, m., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Παταρευς</span>, <i>the
			Patarean</i>, a surname of Apollo: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Delius et Patareus Apollo,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Hor.
					C. 3, 4, 64</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Pătăsaeus</span></b> , a, um,
				adj., <i>Pararœan</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">regia,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. M.
					1, 516</span></i>
			. dumeta, <i><span class="en">Stat. Th. 1,
			696</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>C.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Pătărēis</span></b> ,
				īdis, f.
			adj., <i>Patarœan</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">arx,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Avien. Perieg. 684</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>D.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Pătārānus</span></b> , a,
			um, adj., <i>Patarœan</i>
			hence, in <i>plur. subst.</i>, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Pătărāni</span></b> ,
			ōrum. m., <i>the inhabitants of
				Patara</i>, <i><span class="en">Cic. Fl. 32,
		78</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
